'''Maxor''' is a {{mcat|boss}} along with [[Storm]], [[Goldor]] and [[Necron]] of [[The Catacombs]] in [[The Catacombs - Floor VII]] and is a disciple of [[The Wither King]].

== Collection ==
Killing Maxor and ALL other Withers increases the Necron collection.
{{:Necron/Collection UI}}
{{CollectionTable|Necron}}

== Boss Fight ==
The boss fight is split into four phases (Five phases in Master Mode). There are four Wither Lords: '''Maxor''', [[Storm]], [[Goldor]] and [[Necron]]. Each Wither will be a boss for a phase that must be killed individually for each phase.

=== Phase 1 ===
Maxor's fight begins in a factory-like arena. Once the fight begins, large numbers of Wither Miners and Guards appear in the arena. He will be invulnerable. Players must retrieve two Energy Crystals from high ledges and place them on the podiums at the sides of the arena. This activates a laser at the back of the arena, which Maxor must be lured into. This process must be done at least twice. The first time Maxor is in the laser, he will be vulnerable until losing 75% of his {{Stat|health}}. After that, Maxor becomes enraged and invulnerable again. The second time or later, Maxor becomes vulnerable, but doesn't have a damage cap. Once Maxor dies, the players will progress into the next phase.

