== Trivia ==
*'''Maxor''' was going to be the {{mcat|b}} of [[The Catacombs - Floor VII]] before Hypixel removed Maxor, [[Goldor]] and [[Storm]] from the game and replaced them with [[Necron]].
**All three bosses were later re-added to The Catacombs - Floor VII.
*{{Item|Maxor's Armor}} and {{Item|Maxor the Fish}} are references to this boss.
*Starting in 1.21.5 and beyond, '''Maxor''', '''Storm''', & '''Necron''' will now appear with normal textures of the Wither.
*In 2020, a [https://twitter.com/jayavarmen/status/1305837228329926657/ video] was posted by Jayavarmen of the original Goldor fight.

